<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Now, that's everyone finished."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="1"> handed everyone's paper dolls back to them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Who should I vote for?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s story made me happy, and for impact, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s was the best.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the one whose ending I don't want to imagine any further is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s on my team, so I can't vote for her... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I'm voting, maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Under my own name, I wrote '</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'.</STYLE><PG>
"Now then, I'll announce the results."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With the paper dolls collected, </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="1"> went through them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE>, three votes. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE>, two votes. <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, one vote. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE>'s team and <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE>'s team got three votes each. That settles it. 
{PAUSE ""}
The winner is... no one!"
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="3">! What do you mean, no winner? Isn't it a tie for first place?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"In this contest, there's only ever one winner!<STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE>So, no winner and no loser!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmph..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I underestimated </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. You're not only cute, you can put on all kinds of theatrics like this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">You really are a genius girl."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"W-Well, naturally! I voted for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, which means I had no choice but to acknowledge you too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, having said that, reached out to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for a handshake.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like things would settle peacefully.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But... I'm still holding a teeny grudge about the chest talk.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―When I looked at the clock, it was 21:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh...! I brought fireworks, so can we set them off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm... Well, I suppose that's fine. Have it finished by 10."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> happily went back up to the second floor.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"While we're at it, let's all do fireworks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Ahaha! Fireworks, fireworks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having woken up at some point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was all excited too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It's bedtime for kids!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Whaaat!? Why not! I wanna play with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> too!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I've still got the kitchen to clean up, so I'll go do that! You all go have fun!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I think I'll join in. What about </STYLE>Grandma<STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Me... let's see... I'll get some tea and snacks ready for the fireworks crew."<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ta-da!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">　A Value-Size Jumbo Fireworks Set!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\花火セット.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had brought quite a lot of fireworks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even skyrockets...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, skyrockets would bother the neighbors, so stick to the handheld ones, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know that!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "50"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\花火.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\花火.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, 10 at once is way too greedy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So what! There's a ton of them!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Don't climb trees holding fireworks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"'Cause where the fireworks fall, it's pretty, like a waterfall!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Ah! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Don't take all of those!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I was a little tired from the long trip, so after enjoying a few fireworks, I sat down on the veranda.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone's so full of energy...</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Fireworks mean summer, but fireworks among dancing cherry blossoms are pretty nice too.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\花火.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I looked up at the cherry tree lit by the fireworks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This cherry tree must have watched over the Arata settlement for hundreds of years.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It really might be bigger than Motoki-cho's goshinboku.</STYLE><PG>
"At times like this, it's nice to have things lively."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Who is this...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She was carrying tea and snacks.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, right, it's </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's the first time I've seen her when she isn't doing an impression of anyone.</STYLE><PG>
"Upsy-daisy."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Obaasan<STYLE ID="1"> sat down next to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her profile looked much more youthful than when she was imitating </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her back was straight, and her skin had a healthy glow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Eating such wonderful food every day must be what lets her age this healthily.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田桜1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"This cherry tree is really magnificent."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The first person to come to the Arata settlement built a house beside this cherry tree. 
{PAUSE ""}
As a goshinboku, so it would watch over the settlement. It's over 800 years old."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"So the Arata settlement was founded 800 years ago?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. Back then, they say, someone of the imperial bloodline came here to escape the wars."<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"The imperial bloodline...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"They say the wars dragged in even the imperial family, so they had to flee all the way into these deep mountains. 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, thanks to that person, I get to do fireworks with everyone like this, and see the cherry blossoms with <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see. That historical background must be part of why this cherry tree gives off such a divine aura.</STYLE><PG>
"But lately this tree hasn't been doing so well... 
{PAUSE ""}
It seems the roots are starting to rot. Whether we'll see the blossoms next year..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No wonder the cherry tree's voice seemed dull.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because the cherry tree is weak, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice has trouble getting through.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I won't get another chance to see this storm of cherry petals...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Maybe I don't have that much longer either..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, do you know why I told that story for the ghost stories earlier?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, I had felt the concept was a little off for a ghost story.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"You see, I want to change this Arata settlement..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obaasan<STYLE ID="1"> murmured that </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\花火.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">as she watched everyone's fireworks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The story <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> told earlier, from 10 years ago. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> doesn't seem to remember, but what happened in Megasawa was quite an ordeal, it seems. 
{PAUSE ""}
