<STYLE ID="1">It's true that I barely remember anything about Megasawa.</STYLE><PG>
"Long ago, this was a gloomy, insular settlement, just like <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and the others imagine... 
{PAUSE ""}
