{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>'s parents should know about what happened in Megasawa, so if you're curious, ask them. 
{PAUSE ""}
