{PAUSE ""}
That's what this Arata settlement lacks... Arata as it is now must not be allowed to stand. 
{PAUSE ""}
I want to make it a place where everyone can live happily, with nothing to be ashamed of..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So, in other words...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="5">, the ghost story earlier... could it be..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
