{MESON "500"}
"It really happened, 50 years ago. Someone in this settlement killed the official. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm the oldest in the settlement now, so the culprit is probably no longer alive... 
{PAUSE ""}
But that kind of temperament still remains. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's why I... want to change it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE>Obaasan<STYLE ID="1"> sipped her tea.</STYLE><PG>
"One for all, all for one. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's the slogan of the Arata settlement. When someone in the settlement is in trouble, we help them, no matter what it takes. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even if it's something like killing a person..."<PG>
"But that's wrong... If you truly want to help someone, you find what that person truly wants. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's what I thought when I heard how <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> saved <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and the others..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Did I really do something that amazing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and Mom later.</STYLE><PG>
"But even in a small settlement, things don't go that smoothly. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even when I, the head, say something, who knows what's going on beneath the surface..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh... What kinds of things were they doing here?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Making a drug―something like narcotics. 
{PAUSE ""}
But all of that was supposed to have been disposed of before I came here. 
{PAUSE ""}
It was supposed to have been..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Narcotics...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　To make money with... or something?"</STYLE><PG>
"No, a drug to heighten physical ability, they say. Apparently it was used when hunting and such, before the war. 
{PAUSE ""}
But the Grand Witch of the time banned its use, so by the time I was a child it should've been wiped out. 
{PAUSE ""}
They say that drug had been made quietly in this settlement since 500 years ago, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's what you'd call a bad tradition that lasted until just recently."<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um, so... you mean that drug might still be around?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. There are a few things that make me think so."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But even if I questioned everyone about it, nothing would come out. 
{PAUSE ""}
To start using something banned again, there must have been some serious reason."<PG>
"But after what happened in Megasawa, my heart changed too. 
{PAUSE ""}
Things can't stay like this, after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
If something was banned, there was a proper reason for it. 
{PAUSE ""}
