{PAUSE ""}
Even if it looks like justice, it's sure to come back as a terrible outcome."<PG>
"I want to put an end to that sort of thing now. 
{PAUSE ""}
Making a drug like that is probably against the law in the first place, and in this modern age, you can't live going against the world. 
{PAUSE ""}
So this settlement should properly live by society's rules too. 
{PAUSE ""}
Society's laws and the ancestors' <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おきて">rules</STYLE> alike should, truly, be one for all, all for one."<PG>
"Well, I don't have proof that such a drug still exists, though. 
{PAUSE ""}
And that way of thinking of mine isn't good either. Me, the head, doubting everyone in the settlement until suspicion feeds on itself. 
{PAUSE ""}
Evil things... have to end now. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll make it a place where everyone can be trusted. That's what I've decided."<PG>
